78
00:14:32.301 --> 00:14:33.560
How EFS works.

79
00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:53.678
These controls are designed to work the same way whether you access Claude directly from Anthropic or through a cloud partner. Customers on Amazon Web Services, Google Cloud, and Microsoft Azure will get equivalent controls, with their activity data stored in their own cloud account, in the environment they already trust.

80
00:14:53.798 --> 00:15:01.385
We’re also working to support third-party offerings that serve customers that are eligible for Enterprise Frontier Safeguards.

81
00:15:01.835 --> 00:15:16.148
Customer-owned storage, Customer-Managed Encryption Keys, and fully automated review are each opt-in, so you enable the ones your organization needs. None of them change model behavior, A P I pricing, or rate limits.

82
00:15:16.598 --> 00:15:32.616
Anthropic doesn’t charge for Enterprise Frontier Safeguards. If customers elect to store their data in their cloud account, their cloud provider bills them for that storage, as well as reads, writes, and data egress fees, the same way it bills any other resource.

83
